ice</field><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="Kx2#c?QVcQRi0m9j[UOQ"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="#9L)jRUcXgV{F9V3;gM4"><field name="VAR" id="oL07ZOjV)su|xz-V#~Fy">secret_open</field><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="PG0p}R7~|1qIUnf7}unt"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow><block type="logic_boolean" id=".l8%P(3kWSyrj#eth9hE"><field name="BOOL">FALSE</field></block></value><next><block type="controls_if" id="]hI`ks:D5)#7zIl%/mv/"><mutation elseif="6" else="1"></mutation><value name="IF0"><shadow type="logic_boolean" id="A!%|z^zmIv-tQ=68-~cB"><field name="BOOL">TRUE</field></shadow><block type="logic_compare" id="a}s*+iQGslzoBB`.uf|V"><field name="OP">EQ</field><value name="A"><shadow type="math_number" id="`=GSu.):^jTY{4;.!h{^"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow><block type="variables_get" id="n;~m?(n!yD,4J:)gxXmK"><field name="VAR" id="-vu#A0eJg+Svis8%BH}v">node</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="c*40,36[jvzK-mPJ56;9"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow></value></block></value><statement name="DO0"><block type="variables_set" id="Ocl8eY7}p[uJEE6MmDko"><field name="VAR" id="?2SMJJw%BKa]a]m}qarX">scene_text</field><comment pinned="false" h="80" w="160">1-1. 혁신단 조직과 일제의 추적</comment><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="WrujfT5gjIPyyU`e~Py~"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow><block type="text" id="X=lO#f9`BaLG3DYNoK?n"><field name="TEXT">1919~1920년 경성. 김상옥은 영덕철물점에서 독립운동에 참여한다. 혁신단을 조직한 뒤 일제 경찰의 추적이 거세졌다. 이제 어떤 길을 선택할까?</field></block></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="O[z3DZHM[GcAIgwlF13;"><field name="VAR" id="j)9q{S`W*pgcY0[/IQgr">option_names</field><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="[dqqgRY:CoR^vF5nHc?Z"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow><block type="lists_create_with" id="1I~{G(NJl:z,9wp@ypYi"><mutation items="3" horizontalafter="3"></mutation><value name="ADD0"><shadow type="text" id="!Ppag+WO6Upz{|2^97|L"><field name="TEXT">B: 공개 시위</field></shadow></value><value name="ADD1"><shadow type="text" id="H28p[)[SQ=R?hPbhH[~y"><field name="TEXT">C: 경찰에 청원</field></shadow></value><value name="ADD2"><shadow type="text" id="AtKz]fOZMS-4dBjNUS~o"><field name="TEXT">A: 비밀 조직</field></shadow></value></block></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="[yV@W~aHMGk_w3Edv5$Z"><field name="VAR" id="n32~QMiAJiV1~QLI9:4f">option_targets</field><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="4ZTvB`!w2FW7+3lwbR1p"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow><block type="lists_create_with" id="vuFiys,Q4l%tb~,cWfLf"><mutation items="3" horizontalafter="3"></mutation><value name="ADD0"><shadow type="math_number" id="?6M$v7r0nmSI[k1$_*^?"><field name="NUM">-1</field></shadow></value><value name="ADD1"><shadow type="math_number" id="^lXvQKCqv](er*9e+1YC"><field name="NUM">-2</field></shadow></value><value name="ADD2"><shadow type="math_number" id="aHlLZ*+!Yfsh}Jr@`5HY"><field name="NUM">1</field></shadow></value></block></value></block></next></block></next></block></statement><value name="IF1"><shadow type="logic_boolean" id="9$~LPt[iX@HYL]iRQvWs"><field name="BOOL">TRUE</field></shadow><block type="logic_compare" id="L2n:o;,_@}?0(;I[#X1D"><field name="OP">EQ</field><value name="A"><shadow type="math_number" id="*(Llv?)*y#BlHLuvbJ%`"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow><block type="variables_get" id="N_eX]XJcp55xJE6gx/fw"><field name="VAR" id="-vu#A0eJg+Svis8%BH}v">node</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="gSjeW=i^sN)lOgK!TQt3"><field name="NUM">1</field></shadow></value></block></value><statement name="DO1"><block type="variables_set" id="1*OPkS`I?wqdqiX8`%N]"><field name="VAR" id="?2SMJJw%BKa]a]m}qarX">scene_text</field><comment pinned="false" h="80" w="160">1-2. 상하이에서 동지들과 협력</comment><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="9,aB)fC+R!k~YxkIzXJH"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow><block type="text" id="]a#T}Duejz97F0N$E8TO"><field name="TEXT">상하이. 김상옥은 의열단과 연결되어 비밀 임무를 준비한다. 필요한 물자와 도움을 얻으려면 누구를 믿어야 할까?</field></block></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="DWX#~4fa=;ulrqDH4,7="><field name="VAR" id="j)9q{S`W*pgcY0[/IQgr">option_names</field><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="Iu@BqVPx1k48Fq^#c?ND"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow><block type="lists_create_with" id="b1$OvQ}}@*:$bAt8~U:+"><mutation items="3" horizontalafter="3"></mutation><value name="ADD0"><shadow type="text" id="Bk=6AOCv;PQ}!EU:wcX%"><field name="TEXT">B: 암시장 거래</field></shadow></value><value name="ADD1"><shadow type="text" id="^TI0XBQv3F7c:d]|x@vm"><field name="TEXT">C: 배 단독 공격</field></shadow></value><value name="ADD2"><shadow type="text" id="/2=@o7h1FXVM}u@:_/%H"><field name="TEXT">A: 동지들과 협력</field></shadow></value></block></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="lQ|jpP^m(`5*O!GTp*cO"><field name="VAR" id="n32~QMiAJiV1~QLI9:4f">option_targets</field><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="rgy.[YFb9gt~;?!Cn%+s"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow><block type="lists_create_with" id="$mg,A~B;0iQz_D6|{E=R"><mutation items="3" horizontalafter="3"></mutation><value name="ADD0"><shadow type="math_number" id="gR*6.+*k~T^3)WgX@x8@"><field name="NUM">-3</field></shadow></value><value name="ADD1"><shadow type="math_number" id="GU.T;*k$:3?CNRlnUHoT"><field name="NUM">-4</field></shadow></value><value name="ADD2"><shadow type="math_number" id="4f$pgI]I4Gt+K@$$=y.J"><field name="NUM">2</field></shadow></value></block></value></block></next></block></next></block></statement><value name="IF2"><shadow type="logic_boolean" id="xv.M~hL0`|qyJ;WXJ.,G"><field name="BOOL">TRUE</field></shadow><block type="logic_compare" id="f[]Yt,IIvWo89U!MHl_z"><field name="OP">EQ</field><value name="A"><shadow type="math_number" id="-C?]GP+t%`{P%zbW6M?e"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow><block type="variables_get" id=":/huA}?[I+TdNv.Pc[1|"><field name="VAR" id="-vu#A0eJg+Svis8%BH}v">node</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="Z77}%t%#{?hHsiQi]DZ#"><field name="NUM">2</field></shadow></value></block></value><statement name="DO2"><block type="variables_set" id="nBsjjnY8*z_L!#A[|jbI"><field name="VAR" id="?2SMJJw%BKa]a]m}qarX">scene_text</field><comment pinned="false" h="80" w="160">2-1. 압록강 도하와 숨겨진 선택지</comment><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="6@w:~8(vg/JmH+ML:RNz"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow><block type="text" id="dF)c]JlQ-bIxtf|Z]jv!"><field name="TEXT">1922년 겨울. 압록강이 얼어붙었다. 김상옥은 국경 수비대의 눈을 피해 조선으로 돌아가야 한다. 어떤 경로를 선택할까? 어딘가에 숨겨진 선택지도 있다.</field></block></value><next><block type="variables_set" id=",+OI)wC=@Z4F,pLXG(6#"><field name="VAR" id="j)9q{S`W*pgcY0[/IQgr">option_names</field><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="JrKRFU{ve;jt|NFQ4[5v"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow><block type="lists_create_with" id=",4$lL$[YA0~l#g|m5Av%"><mutation items="3" horizontalafter="3"></mutation><value name="ADD0"><shadow type="text" id="LgeGXS@S{u}R~ZMuWBY1"><field name="TEXT">B: 다리 검문소</field></shadow></value><value name="ADD1"><shadow type="text" id="6)5FM9e6fA}%eJBeDr-V"><field name="TEXT">C: 밀수꾼 고용</field></shadow></value><value name="ADD2"><shadow type="text" id="c|S/r9@^G1F3rXZ(,H$,"><field name="TEXT">A: 밤에 건너기</field></shadow></value></block></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="}cFJpgR@;5KOLQx1[Rr-"><field name="VAR" id="n32~QMiAJiV1~QLI9:4f">option_targets</field><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="Se?ulZ7_:[y~cNewD:q|"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow><block type="lists_create_with" id="X#SILsQ~R6l#QIghY_B)"><mutation items="3" horizontalafter="3"></mutation><value name="ADD0"><shadow type="math_number" id=".#91d`cjdi*wH7N#iLuF"><field name="NUM">-5</field></shadow></value><value name="ADD1"><shadow type="math_number" id="I]y5,{dD`MY$$10*=$=~"><field name="NUM">-6</field></shadow></value><value name="ADD2"><shadow type="math_number" id="NALU{!0[KU?n_pzsWOAf"><field name="NUM">3</field></shadow></value></block></value></block></next></block></next></block></statement><value name="IF3"><shadow type="logic_boolean" id="Zn-%-T|]#Dgw{.aGP.jR"><field name="BOOL">TRUE</field></shadow><block type="logic_compare" id="hLc}Vo2;aaGiW[9C4RZj"><field name="OP">EQ</field><value name="A"><shadow type="math_number" id="0x,rQm~YAfi+ueG?}pMD"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow><block type="variables_get" id="A27H*[+Ol`nm{o2R[i8J"><field name="VAR" id="-vu#A0eJg+Svis8%BH}v">node</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="aS;HO[^@#[bL50^ujKhp"><field name="NUM">3</field></shadow></value></block></value><statement name="DO3"><block type="variables_set" id="!pLba5cFGrAoIjv$4yb_"><field name="VAR" id="?2SMJJw%BKa]a]m}qarX">scene_text</field><comment pinned="false" h="80" w="160">2-2. 종로경찰서 사건: 투탄 주체에 대한 역사적 이견 있음</comment><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="n6TFLkAoiO/:n.E1paAk"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow><block type="text" id="t|Kqt9.9rx@y(1QRj.nG"><field name="TEXT">1923년 1월 12일, 종로경찰서에 폭탄이 터지고 주변 사람들이 다쳤다. 경성에는 삼엄한 경계가 펼쳐졌다. 폭탄을 던진 인물이 누구인지는 역사적으로 견해가 엇갈린다. 이 게임은 널리 알려진 서술을 바탕으로 한다.</field></block></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="c`s|xXuy%GI359_0ZdY;"><field name="VAR" id="j)9q{S`W*pgcY0[/IQgr">option_names</field><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="xD#?SH|WdPAL]kY2L`g?"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow><block type="lists_create_with" id="OkbxPFQ`/#rVh2BR^Bj)"><mutation items="2" horizontalafter="3"></mutation><value name="ADD0"><shadow type="text" id="(;vKG12#_a!%u`Ezt/LR"><field name="TEXT">B: 정문으로 접근</field></shadow></value><value name="ADD1"><shadow type="text" id="l7__.Tu[xSm]Mrz{|Tog"><field name="TEXT">A: 서쪽 창문</field></shadow></value></block></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="}70!{Cjv5pHqlW/72MB2"><field name="VAR" id="n32~QMiAJiV1~QLI9:4f">option_targets</field><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="nL+[ttx*WlUjDneGrfIL"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow><block type="lists_create_with" id="9@hzru}Y;U5~W`$o%BXK"><mutation items="2" horizontalafter="3"></mutation><value name="ADD0"><shadow type="math_number" id="1_3Ap^%W9V=t64NPi2wR"><field name="NUM">-7</field></shadow></value><value name="ADD1"><shadow type="math_number" id="/p@jPe{=vt!thrk305s:"><field name="NUM">4</field></shadow></value></block></value></block></next></block></next></block></statement><value name="IF4"><shadow type="logic_boolean" id="v$eq7O#uBrJMW:}isZoy"><field name="BOOL">TRUE</field></shadow><block type="logic_compare" id="CWimw@9N%yJ|y6!kP8Z_"><field name="OP">EQ</field><value name="A"><shadow type="math_number" id="zEb4q[GVOIN44zqdx[hT"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow><block type="variables_get" id="3_wx9(=omv}=Woi1Bo)$"><field name="VAR" id="-vu#A0eJg+Svis8%BH}v">node</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="{h}=D)Zf%]H7-tZWRr%m"><field name="NUM">4</field></shadow></value></block></value><statement name="DO4"><block type="variables_set" id="AK|]K]`7GGy`!LDnQ^7z"><field name="VAR" id="?2SMJJw%BKa]a]m}qarX">scene_text</field><comment pinned="false" h="80" w="160">3-1. 삼판통 은신처 포위: 열차 작전은 가상 분기</comment><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="Qu@Fq^%F{)}xPua;Hn7:"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow><block type="text" id="t22ac62}1p8W=A-N(L1i"><field name="TEXT">1923년 1월 17일. 다무라 형사가 이끄는 일제 경찰이 삼판통 은신처를 포위했다. 탈출로가 좁혀지고 있다. 일부 선택지는 실제 역사와 다른 가상 이야기다.</field></block></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="/;WI|W_[M6o/b{_GKk[R"><field name="VAR" id="j)9q{S`W*pgcY0[/IQgr">option_names</field><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id=");?6{+TdrDh}~Yi@g-.o"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow><block type="lists_create_with" id="cUl/o!ei74O5bF2gbYzs"><mutation items="3" horizontalafter="3"></mutation><value name="ADD0"><shadow type="text" id="zp2x@[uYMDe[LoX!b/nT"><field name="TEXT">B: 열차 작전(가상)</field></shadow></value><value name="ADD1"><shadow type="text" id="nP_hE`0REw~Y1-Sf6(#p"><field name="TEXT">C: 뒷골목 탈출</field></shadow></value><value name="ADD2"><shadow type="text" id="d{b6zhI*!{M$(M!~6)!c"><field name="TEXT">A: 지붕으로 탈출</field></shadow></value></block></value><next><block type="variables_set" id=":U2?kNfE{s)SmRex,Nt0"><field name="VAR" id="n32~QMiAJiV1~QLI9:4f">option_targets</field><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="0?7`ubxfDaku^}EUNnal"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow><block type="lists_create_with" id="P}?O,yhkH:pSrDhhC27W"><mutation items="3" horizontalafter="3"></mutation><value name="ADD0"><shadow type="math_number" id="S{(3FvGys5QMYBQl%N2P"><field name="NUM">-15</field></shadow></value><value name="ADD1"><shadow type="math_number" id="{B:bi^wR90{Va]e~we(Q"><field name="NUM">-8</field></shadow></value><value name="ADD2"><shadow type="math_number" id="[40?3%9=RdJ[sKoVfmm-"><field name="NUM">5</field></shadow></value></block></value></block></next></block></next></block></statement><value name="IF5"><shadow type="logic_boolean" id="*~1;7Zl.J5NMgM*edQCO"><field name="BOOL">TRUE</field></shadow><block type="logic_compare" id="~A(L8B4PC`+9M;OUz/iK"><field name="OP">EQ</field><value name="A"><shadow type="math_number" id="Jl(j%g30~s}:@{Q~aj1T"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow><block type="variables_get" id="Ybw~sDyNc+2SFStzXx@Y"><field name="VAR" id="-vu#A0eJg+Svis8%BH}v">node</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="otYr)QB5A:d4ns.0i5{1"><field name="NUM">5</field></shadow></value></block></value><statement name="DO5"><block type="variables_set" id="s}a_`2D_P~HlH)o*2`m7"><field name="VAR" id="?2SMJJw%BKa]a]m}qarX">scene_text</field><comment pinned="false" h="80" w="160">3-2. 남산 탈출과 안장사 승복, 효제동 은신</comment><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="|N@hwdG@Hyx*uc]AFX6C"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow><block type="text" id="P6mLNEwR[62yU,S+vAW$"><field name="TEXT">김상옥은 눈 덮인 남산을 넘어 포위망을 벗어났다. 기록에 따르면 안장사에서 승복을 빌려 입고, 이혜수의 도움을 받아 효제동에 있는 이태성의 집으로 몸을 숨겼다.</field></block></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="(uCa@Jl}#1y!Q|~~1!Ts"><field name="VAR" id="j)9q{S`W*pgcY0[/IQgr">option_names</field><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="?(+Xl(zA=%5UR]IpQ`1#"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow><block type="lists_create_with" id="DRZ9TX!dia{dGO1PTuWW"><mutation items="3" horizontalafter="3"></mutation><value name="ADD0"><shadow type="text" id="@H%r_2TY?C0BWu4PbrFg"><field name="TEXT">B: 남산에 남기</field></shadow></value><value name="ADD1"><shadow type="text" id="amsm~.hlr*D.P)k+J+T@"><field name="TEXT">C: 다리로 이동</field></shadow></value><value name="ADD2"><shadow type="text" id="yNvder}ICW8~~=Q!6o.g"><field name="TEXT">A: 승복으로 변장</field></shadow></value></block></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="09G]~A4R`|A/G@/Sdrf8"><field name="VAR" id="n32~QMiAJiV1~QLI9:4f">option_targets</field><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="k)PW`*;;(+x[S=H{I9l#"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow><block type="lists_create_with" id=",ILiQV#X2;4nrW0RB~)0"><mutation items="3" horizontalafter="3"></mutation><value name="ADD0"><shadow type="math_number" id="-G4rJA`Ymeq`G/J@h(RY"><field name="NUM">-9</field></shadow></value><value name="ADD1"><shadow type="math_number" id="fGo#M9Nu8h=.(T=sPRlW"><field name="NUM">-10</field></shadow></value><value name="ADD2"><shadow type="math_number" id="1r2WQQso:gz*yA^r}ZC."><field name="NUM">6</field></shadow></value></block></value></block></next></block></next></block></statement><value name="IF6"><shadow type="logic_boolean" id="HXd!%kaTS/y.Zvm-w$p`"><field name="BOOL">TRUE</field></shadow><block type="logic_compare" id="Z0~E1kv2?vXV||HUwRza"><field name="OP">EQ</field><value name="A"><shadow type="math_number" id="9=EMf!6VF,QL9*_~%2nn"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow><block type="variables_get" id=")E5#!2FLks!Ukhb0dM]8"><field name="VAR" id="-vu#A0eJg+Svis8%BH}v">node</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="dNn==Ha:|Q6.Q61Nwz{9"><field name="NUM">6</field></shadow></value></block></value><statement name="DO6"><block type="variables_set" id="7R/oKm.FTIfZAxs:=!$@"><field name="VAR" id="?2SMJJw%BKa]a]m}qarX">scene_text</field><comment pinned="false" h="80" w="160">4-1. 효제동에서의 마지막 항전</comment><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="~wLjd@]iHLl).b`wVyn^"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow><block type="text" id="7ON%h3I]@}AVCJm79~!8"><field name="TEXT">1923년 1월 22일. 경찰과 군인 약 1천 명이 효제동 은신처를 포위했다. 김상옥은 몇 시간 동안 홀로 맞서 싸웠다. 마지막 순간, 어떤 선택을 할까?</field></block></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="8G52UX/]ZwrFE!}N{zOJ"><field name="VAR" id="j)9q{S`W*pgcY0[/IQgr">option_names</field><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="wf$_acG.[B+YxD(`J*Q}"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow><block type="lists_create_with" id="Zpo*uf,5qh+1`N4or?FJ"><mutation items="3" horizontalafter="3"></mutation><value name="ADD0"><shadow type="text" id="Tf]-a,duml]*Ak6w?KvV"><field name="TEXT">B: 마당으로 나가기</field></shadow></value><value name="ADD1"><shadow type="text" id="[o-D*dUAf0MEWC!ewRMx"><field name="TEXT">C: 항복하기</field></shadow></value><value name="ADD2"><shadow type="text" id="e2ko}**t3e,AD1k}|8|j"><field name="TEXT">A: 지붕에서 항전</field></shadow></value></block></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="}*nK?Syz(nn.4kz)@Xh!"><field name="VAR" id="n32~QMiAJiV1~QLI9:4f">option_targets</field><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="O.G,MaA8mbk^wp`jiM:A"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow><block type="lists_create_with" id="Mn@]k+nt?(k;zT3_%*G|"><mutation items="3" horizontalafter="3"></mutation><value name="ADD0"><shadow type="math_number" id="FQ(UQPN9wTJCGPl$ptq*"><field name="NUM">-11</field></shadow></value><value name="ADD1"><shadow type="math_number" id="aQ3Uop,c@CzYHo#9.kB}"><field name="NUM">-12</field></shadow></value><value name="ADD2"><shadow type="math_number" id="1_]!fYNr_:7}3=)[/8v$"><field name="NUM">7</field></shadow></value></block></value></block></next></block></next></block></statement><statement name="ELSE"><block type="variables_set" id="uhv!5{UXR6ht{Fj,(IPe"><field name="VAR" id="?2SMJJw%BKa]a]m}qarX">scene_text</field><comment pinned="false" h="80" w="160">4-2. 마지막 탄환과 역사 엔딩</comment><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="bXW!k|zZt`fhZ+_:fy{N"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow><block type="text" id="C7v9@[=PjiEb9#(Dd~)i"><field name="TEXT">마지막 탄환 하나가 남았다. 김상옥은 일제에 생포되지 않겠다고 결심한다. 역사 속 그의 최후는 모두가 살아남는 승리의 결말이 아니었다.</field></block></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="H|Uy-qQwMIieiD=icVjz"><field name="VAR" id="j)9q{S`W*pgcY0[/IQgr">option_names</field><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="ImU|d-`vzm?Jq(s`z{4K"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow><block type="lists_create_with" id="XXEXW{9Il(vq)iKmLE2Y"><mutation items="2" horizontalafter="3"></mutation><value name="ADD0"><shadow type="text" id="ot3h(,{Im$vNFE7IM]X,"><field name="TEXT">B: 빈 총으로 돌진</field></shadow></value><value name="ADD1"><shadow type="text" id="yp#zQRC?m.tuIkpp@*#d"><field name="TEXT">A: 마지막까지 항전</field></shadow></value></block></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="vA;#MpIn~{1fn{-mmY`5"><field name="VAR" id="n32~QMiAJiV1~QLI9:4f">option_targets</field><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="TPkRo+[OJ|SLBUH!kA5s"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow><block type="lists_create_with" id="oEr@Q3tp6/u#6Pw#x6yO"><mutation items="2" horizontalafter="3"></mutation><value name="ADD0"><shadow type="math_number" id="AMf^/i4w,PK/4]Fu9??#"><field name="NUM">-13</field></shadow></value><value name="ADD1"><shadow type="math_number" id="M6y0Slz9G@wQDIR+yK|A"><field name="NUM">-14</field></shadow></value></block></value></block></next></block></next></block></statement><next><block type="function_call" id="qqJDq}].kkm%X/tXL.rv"><mutation name="draw_node" functionid="]@4D0NM#FNiuW+@!|*;v"></mutation><next><block type="game_show_long_text" id=":$`wF^W2a;x9XA,{9jX$"><field name="layout">DialogLayout.Full</field><value name="str"><shadow type="text" id="i+:xOLg;S0G#